<title>FRANCE: Chargeurs, Gamma ally to make car seat fabric.</title>
<headline>Chargeurs, Gamma ally to make car seat fabric.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chargeurs International said on Wednesday that its unit Delcar had reached a partnership agreement with De Witte Lietaer, belonging to Dutch group Gamma, to make car seat fabric.</p>
<p>The alliance would vault the two companies into the &quot;top European ranks for making car seat fabric,&quot; the French group said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said &quot;the competitiveness of the new group, the increased know-how and European creativity, will lay the foundations for accelerated development.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
